* >Natural Source Header 000000
* :Mode R
* :CP
* :LineIncrement 10
* <Natural Source Header
DECIDE ON EVERY VALUE OF G-DIRECT-COMMAND
  VALUE 'UP'
    MOVE TRUE TO #BACKWARD
    IF G-SCROLL-AMOUNT > 1
      MOVE G-SCROLL-AMOUNT TO #SCROLL-AMOUNT
     END-IF
  VALUE 'DOWN'
    MOVE TRUE TO #FORWARD
    IF G-SCROLL-AMOUNT > 1
      MOVE G-SCROLL-AMOUNT TO #SCROLL-AMOUNT
     END-IF
  VALUE 'TOP'
    MOVE TRUE TO #TOP
* gw 96-10-15 s(999999) following line added
    MOVE TRUE TO #NEWVAL
  VALUE 'BOT'
    MOVE TRUE TO #BOT
  ANY VALUE
     RESET G-DIRECT-COMMAND
     ESCAPE TOP
NONE IGNORE
END-DECIDE
